---

<a
    href={url}
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="text-dark-400 hover:text-ruby-500 transition-colors duration-200"
    style="margin-right: 0.5rem;"
>
    <span set:html={getSocialIcon(url)} />
</a>
